id: erratic-basic-attack
name: Erratic Majin: Basic Attack
type: instant
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
# Erratic Majin (5)'s, open while it applies.
special: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  You may use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Instant Maneuver, instead of a Standard Maneuver, but you must still spend 1 Action to use it.
text: >
  (5)-[Passive]: You may use the Basic Attack Maneuver as an Instant Maneuver, instead of a Standard Maneuver, but you must still spend 1 Action to use the Basic Attack Maneuver.
  –Maneuver Type: Instant Maneuver
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –KP Cost: N/A (the Basic Attack's)
  –Effect: Use the Basic Attack Maneuver.

---

[on used]
maneuverOutOfSequence(basic-attack);
